<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:39:03Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>EU to condemn war in Ukraine at G20 even if Putin attends</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:836d0d6ecb97299844742ddcaf8dd46a79c3d97bcae0d857d890b7c0f46a00e0</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:28Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T13:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-to-condemn-war-in-ukraine-at-g20-even-if-putin-attends/a-79413317--3809a660b511.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-to-condemn-war-in-ukraine-at-g20-even-if-putin-attends/a-79413317?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Russian President Vladimir Putin has been invited to the G20 summit in Miami by the United States. Multiple members of the group have called for Moscow's exclusion over its invasion of Ukraine.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>AI systems shifted their answers toward both left- and right-leaning users in a study. Could sycophantic chatbots deepen political divides?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fe27750d4941d2556238a1801184a49e0cfd8e6648d2ecdb90b5748182a71e5e</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:31Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T13:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ai-systems-shifted-their-answers-toward-both-left-and-right-leaning-users-in-a-study-could-sycophant/a-79377894--6126140be276.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ai-systems-shifted-their-answers-toward-both-left-and-right-leaning-users-in-a-study-could-sycophantic-chatbots-deepen-political-divides/a-79377894?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A study shows chatbots mirror users' politics, part of a broader tendency known as AI sycophancy. Researchers fear this could deepen polarization.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Berlin officially withdraws Olympics bid</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8749fa8f47b0fbdaa2bf7f335e7bf79f6c81f21752eff03b24334f1567339a0b</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T12:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-berlin-officially-withdraws-olympics-bid/live-79406294--30622a12ce08.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-berlin-officially-withdraws-olympics-bid/live-79406294?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Berlin's decision to withdraw its Olympic bid means that only Munich and the western Rhine/Ruhr region are left in the running as potential Olympic hosts. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Czech PM Andrej Babis reiterates importance of NATO for his country but rejects calls to increase defense spending</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:29ae087b1e3e154a23ccecc1f26811b05a29256796006b87512507b61f016046</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T12:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/czech-pm-andrej-babis-reiterates-importance-of-nato-for-his-country-but-rejects-calls-to-increase-de/a-79411066--415ccd460a40.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/czech-pm-andrej-babis-reiterates-importance-of-nato-for-his-country-but-rejects-calls-to-increase-defense-spending/a-79411066?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US and NATO want Czechia to spend more on defense. Czech Prime Minister Andrej Babis says Prague cannot afford faster increases, despite growing warnings about the threat from Russia.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>'Pope fever' takes hold as Pope Leo visits France</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1f7da3b3e48e27d7ed141840736d0716edaa8924b14f34a3bbd519e2a9027c80</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:40Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T12:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pope-fever-takes-hold-as-pope-leo-visits-france/a-79401291--1edb64ca4ad9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pope-fever-takes-hold-as-pope-leo-visits-france/a-79401291?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV is expected to draw large crowds during his visit to France. As part of his trip to Europe, he's also set to address the continent's future and some of the challenges ahead.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>UNGA: Netanyahu, Abbas to speak as Middle East dominates day</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:690c4ee7aeac6543fda1e279a792f8fd5acaaaa9f6155b1d78fa581e511c2ab1</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T11:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/unga-netanyahu-abbas-to-speak-as-middle-east-dominates-day/live-79366211--84fc9978eafa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/unga-netanyahu-abbas-to-speak-as-middle-east-dominates-day/live-79366211?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Israel's Netanyahu can expect to be greeted by protests, while the Palestinian Abbas will address the body via video after the US denied him a visa. Beyond the Middle East, rising sea levels will be on the day 3 agenda.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>As the EU advances free trade with Southeast Asia, why is there no ASEAN-wide deal?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5ea147652c5f4394c9255ca12d5c6530c18a10396eaa4e744c211570a8680054</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:37:30Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T11:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/as-the-eu-advances-free-trade-with-southeast-asia-why-is-there-no-asean-wide-deal/a-79388278--5f329cf78840.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/as-the-eu-advances-free-trade-with-southeast-asia-why-is-there-no-asean-wide-deal/a-79388278?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After years of arduous negotiations, the EU is closing on a string of bilateral trade deals with countries in Southeast Asia. And yet, a bloc-to-bloc agreement between the EU and ASEAN remains a distant prospect.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Tensions between India and Bangladesh are in focus after Dhaka skipped the BRICS summit in Delhi</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ae9cdf9bfb2f49ee41cac7d1e9033a68c803b217921735615d17e07ffa151eed</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:46Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T11:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/tensions-between-india-and-bangladesh-are-in-focus-after-dhaka-skipped-the-brics-summit-in-delhi/a-79410667--fb62a16b78a2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/tensions-between-india-and-bangladesh-are-in-focus-after-dhaka-skipped-the-brics-summit-in-delhi/a-79410667?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bangladesh's absence from the BRICS summit in New Delhi has raised fresh questions about strained ties. Ousted PM Sheikh Hasina's exile in India remains a major obstacle to normalizing relations.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Cockroach party demands Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar's resignation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2a0b8b73316d09b43a1174c43239317a8209030a9e1a23a1ef13152e9e022a8b</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T11:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-cockroach-party-demands-election-commissioner-gyanesh-kumar-s-resignation/live-79405879--428579042cfb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-cockroach-party-demands-election-commissioner-gyanesh-kumar-s-resignation/live-79405879?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">CJP's Abhijeet Dipke has alleged that the removal of more than 130 million names from draft electoral rolls is designed to benefit the BJP and weaken opposition parties. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Poland says Starlink station fire 'act of sabotage'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:42b189ee024d5327a25e6319919b1607b64712fdb5a5942cca40f1373c51c711</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:52Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T10:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/poland-says-starlink-station-fire-act-of-sabotage/a-79410745--549d54958cd1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/poland-says-starlink-station-fire-act-of-sabotage/a-79410745?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Polish Deputy Prime Minister Krzysztof Gawkowski said Warsaw believed the attack aimed to disrupt internet access for the Ukrainian military, calling it "an element of the next phase of hybrid warfare."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Morocco: Center-right PAM leads in parliamentary election</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:58668669b80f20d9972cecd4a050ecab13962eaefb38dfa1d5f6f67327a835a5</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:55Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T08:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/morocco-center-right-pam-leads-in-parliamentary-election/a-79407710--cbd3d630bc57.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/morocco-center-right-pam-leads-in-parliamentary-election/a-79407710?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">PAM is part of Morocco's outgoing ruling coalition and was founded by an adviser to the king. The moderate Islamist Justice and Development Party surged amid increasing voter apathy.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany: Economic institutes double growth forecast for 2026</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2d1ae58cac01cc8416b6ed301cffe083c10f4751c7e5c864ce59f50fe56d48b4</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:57Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T08:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-economic-institutes-double-growth-forecast-for-2026/a-78168080--b4403b4ba952.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-economic-institutes-double-growth-forecast-for-2026/a-78168080?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Experts predict German GDP will double to 1.3% this year but warn of structural difficulties ahead. The picture is complicated, they say, especially because of uncertainty in the energy sector.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US judge blocks Trump ban of CNN, MS NOW, Politico from White House, orders him to restore access</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9ff0696af47a1728f45876ebb1331764a8b9caaca1b70c4beb42fdb601a1bcbe</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:39:00Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T05:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-judge-blocks-trump-ban-of-cnn-ms-now-politico-from-white-house-orders-him-to-restore-access/a-79405693--b273a6cd0d69.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-judge-blocks-trump-ban-of-cnn-ms-now-politico-from-white-house-orders-him-to-restore-access/a-79405693?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A judge has ordered President Trump to restore White House access to CNN, MS NOW and Politico after he banned the media outlets from the premises.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>OpenAI agent hacked Australia government portal: PM Albanese</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2810603f3fcfa78bd255aba6d5724c2d921c2249f84d979b15126c3c10e575b2</id><updated>2