rade, AI and geopolitics are all on the menu, as the UN General Assembly convenes nearby.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Berlin Airport briefly suspends flights over drone sighting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c854cca8bfedf6bc86cb4baf15b952c12233d3efd0482145c5d8876832c63fee</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:37:30Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T19:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/berlin-airport-briefly-suspends-flights-over-drone-sighting/a-79403865--84b3e93d15cb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/berlin-airport-briefly-suspends-flights-over-drone-sighting/a-79403865?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Airspace over the German capital was closed for about 45 minutes after a drone was spotted on the runway. Flights have resumed but are experiencing delays.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Harvey Weinstein resentenced to 15 years for sexual assault</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:af71bcf750b46b5c8c6e295e932fe196af22f8f1ad904b475a9267847ea5931b</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:37:30Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T17:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/harvey-weinstein-resentenced-to-15-years-for-sexual-assault/a-79403381--8507b6a2aba6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/harvey-weinstein-resentenced-to-15-years-for-sexual-assault/a-79403381?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The disgraced Hollywood mogul was found guilty of sexually assaulting former production assistant Miriam Haley. The man whose case spurred the #MeToo movement awaits a separate sentencing in a California rape case.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>New fighting in Ethiopia's Tigray region raises fears of a return to the country's civil war</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1a7c6a516487ad79600b46fde36f2ecc664b19df8c640643bc465369ff3d2d43</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:37:30Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T17:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/new-fighting-in-ethiopia-s-tigray-region-raises-fears-of-a-return-to-the-country-s-civil-war/a-79400869--cb917e424fac.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/new-fighting-in-ethiopia-s-tigray-region-raises-fears-of-a-return-to-the-country-s-civil-war/a-79400869?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Fighting in and around Tigray is testing Ethiopia's fragile 2022 peace deal. With old enemies forming new alliances, experts warn that the conflict could enter a dangerous new phase.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Eviction of 87-year-old woman sparks housing protests in Madrid</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f1e6d5ed47cfc9d24157fc4785f80b47574e58801a3aa3da2f442163420d8be2</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:37:30Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T16:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eviction-of-87-year-old-woman-sparks-housing-protests-in-madrid/a-79399342--1588b5df3843.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eviction-of-87-year-old-woman-sparks-housing-protests-in-madrid/a-79399342?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Police escorted Maricarmen Abascal from the apartment she had called home for more than seven decades. The case has reignited debate over Spain's housing crisis, rising rents and protections for long-term tenants.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump's Board of Peace proposes $2.45B for reconstruction in Gaza</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e3c65842efdad6f27c7babe57ab07f5e7baf04c96bc10a1982232b344fde415a</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:37:30Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T16:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-s-board-of-peace-proposes-2-45b-for-reconstruction-in-gaza/a-79401612--59213d247592.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-s-board-of-peace-proposes-2-45b-for-reconstruction-in-gaza/a-79401612?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The board has noted that the Palestinian enclave needs roughly $35.2 billion for full, medium-term reconstruction. Trump's plan for peace in Gaza has largely stalled since an agreement was reached almost a year ago.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
